@prefix :     <https://w3id.org/spatial-cognition#> .
@prefix owl:  <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .

:GroundedPerspective a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:subClassOf :Concept ;
    rdfs:label "Grounded perspective"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "A perspective fully determined by the scene: the bound Viewpoint, the bound NavigationInfo (or the one the Viewpoint names), the Viewpoint's ancestor transforms and the scene's unit statements."@en .
